\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S.1}{\ignorespaces Data dictionary for items within the ``properties'' member of GeoJSON objects for 17 experiment-years of precision cotton irrigation research data at Maricopa, Arizona from 2002 to 2023. Variables related to soil, weather, crop, and management data are included, in addition to variables for GeoJSON object labels and unique identifiers. The ``Code'' column provides the keys to access data within the GeoJSON properties members. The ``Type'' column provides the data type of the return value for each key. In some cases, the return value is a list of hash tables (or dictionaries), and the ``Key : Type'' column provides the additional keys and data types of return values for the hash elements in the list. The ``Unit or Format'' column provides specific information on units of measure or string formatting for the return values. Many variable codes were borrowed from the International Consortium for Agricultural Systems Applications (ICASA) data standards \citep {White2013}, and the ``ICASA'' column specifies whether or not the variable code was taken from ICASA. The ``Class Membership'' column provides a list of the data classes in which the variable is found.\relax }}{2}{}%
